#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""cpmatrix - cmatrix-style hex rain with Cyberpunk 2077 hacking animations.

Layers, bottom to top:
  * full-terminal hex-code rain
  * decorative hacking windows (Breach Protocol, Quickhack Upload, Daemons,
    Memory Scan, ICE Breaker, Ping Network, Signal Intercept, Target
    Acquisition). They can chain: a window may spawn a neighbour joined by a
    pulsing connector, and every connected pair spawns a Network Handshake.
  * btop-like live system widgets (CPU, memory, network, disk, processes),
    a separate group with its own spawn timing and capacity
  * short, frequent glitch bursts over everything
  * rarely (1 in 250 windows): a ~200 s deep-search chain of 2-5 linked windows,
    each a unique animation with branching connectors
Every ordinary window (widgets included, shown as a T- countdown) lives a random 5-27 s. q, Esc or Ctrl-C quits.
"""
